From: Leviathan <leviathan@vospek.dev>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 11:52:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] W1-02 MutableBlockPos: scoped reuse utility

Thread-confined reusable mutable position with AutoCloseable scoping,
reentrancy depth tracking, and post-close sentinel values to surface
escape/misuse immediately. This is the pattern NMS BlockPos iteration
sites will adopt in later patches.
---
 .../objectpath/ScopedMutablePos.java          | 86 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 86 insertions(+)
